.TH TENSOR-GPU-PROBE 1 "2026-11-24" "Tensor GPU" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
tensor-gpu-probe \- read-only GPU admission evidence on Tensor
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B python3 shared/scripts/tensor-gpu-probe.py
.RI [ --required-free-mib MiB ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Queries only user systemd service states, local NVIDIA memory and compute
process inventories, local Ollama loaded models, and current-user Wallpaper
Engine processes. Outputs JSON diagnostic evidence, warnings and reasons
why a future GPU admission would be vetoed. Missing data fails closed.
.PP
This tool is NOT a resource lease or permission to launch inference.
It never stops/restarts services, unloads models, purges VRAM, modifies
configurations, or writes runtime queue state.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tensor-gpu-lease (1),
.BR tensor-gpu-queue (1)
.SH SOURCE
iragonforce/ops, reviewed public snapshot target iragonforce/tensor.
